The provided JavaScript code has a few issues. Firstly, it doesn't actually rotate the order of the divs as intended. Secondly, the `getElementsByClassName()` function returns a NodeList of all elements with the specified class name, but in this case, the divs have unique classes. To correctly obtain and manipulate each div, it's better to assign them unique ids.

