In the above code, we first cast the 2D array to `IEnumerable<int>` using the `Cast<int>()` method. Then, we use the `ToArray()` method to convert the `IEnumerable<int>` into a single dimensional array.

The `SelectMany` method essentially flattens the 2D array by concatenating all the inner arrays together into a single enumerable sequence. The `ToArray` method then converts this sequence into a single dimensional array.

